\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Comparison of learning approaches. (a) Traditional methods apply a uniform learning path to all learners, often resulting in suboptimal engagement due to boredom or cognitive overload. (b) The proposed framework employs an AI agent to infer learner states from interaction logs and generate personalized action recommendations (review, standard, or enrichment) to maximize engagement and knowledge mastery.}}{}{}\protected@file@percent }
